{"v":4,"catch":"一款關於虛構時間旅行者掠奪過去偷取食譜的短遊戲。","desc":"跟隨一個襪子傀儡進入時間的黑暗腸道，學習新的食譜。遇見你早已去世的祖先。利用他們來提升你的烹飪技巧。拍一些恐龍的照片。盡可能拿走你能拿的。\n\n這是一個實驗性的故事驅動冒險。不要期望有先進的烹飪遊戲玩法。大多數時候，你會看視頻，煮一些簡單的餐點，試著應對局面失控，並探索一些奇怪的地方。","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2024-02-22","genres":["冒險","模擬","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 3.2GB / Switch 3.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/94c459377e05e12564c79fcbceda96a9babe96ebeda297c8ee362f4d4a041a56.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ede07b46d0e3d365c2c83ed129678a6981671b4e89bcdc85acaa41805e9b73ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df24bc340c538fbbe876e4885e35e5aa487ab7e783b515c43e7ab4bc5f193085.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca81c446f887e92be12052a4db42edeb3441c801542fb57524f559fc44c039a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e33f5fec5707a10eaa38117ec5d05f4d6e5a1c527333b5494908611b298c4575.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b0dc09fb3e88d6f0ee1292d6f264f113b8c4f8481b12ab1733284e356625765.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e2f01d002000","dlc":[]}